  {
    "id": "arena:96761497",
    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "text": "Don’t let liquid pool under multiple keys (capillary spread worsens it)\nDon’t press keys hard while wet (can push sugar deeper into switch)\nDon’t tilt toward screen/hinge (fluid can reach display/backlight area)\nDon’t use high-IPA flood (can damage coatings/adhesives if excessive)\nDon’t mix cleaners (no soap + alcohol combo residue)\nDon’t overuse compressed air (can drive debris deeper / moisture condensation)\nDon’t insert anything that flexes keycaps upward unevenly (snaps scissor clips)\nStop if a key starts “rocking” unusually (clip already weakened)",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/45891085",
    "published_at": "2026-05-06T13:56:53.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T16:09:01.296Z",
    "images": [],
    "tags": [],
    "visibility": "public",
    "meta": {
      "block_type": "Text",
      "channel": {
        "title": "☉ gpt instructions for cleaning my mac keyboard",
        "url": "https://www.are.na/siyang/gpt-instructions-for-cleaning-my-mac-keyboard"
      }
    },
    "kind": "reblog"
  },
  {
    "id": "arena:96761472",
    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "text": "Use only common stuff:\n1) Flip + tap\nPower off, upside down, light taps\n2) Toothpick / wooden skewer\nGently trace key gaps to pull crumbs out (don’t pry up)\n3) Post-it / tape edge\nSticky side into gaps → lift debris\n4) Soft brush (paintbrush / toothbrush)\nWhile inverted, sweep gaps\n5) Alcohol clean\nQ-tip + ≥90% isopropyl\nLightly around edges\nTap key repeatedly\nTilt to drain, dry 30 min\n6) Repeat 2–3x\nAvoid\nRemoving keys\nPaper clips / metal\nWater\nPouring liquid\nIf still sticky: internal residue → replacement only.",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/45891076",
    "published_at": "2026-05-06T13:56:34.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T16:09:01.296Z",
    "images": [],
    "tags": [],
    "visibility": "public",
    "meta": {
      "block_type": "Text",
      "channel": {
        "title": "☉ gpt instructions for cleaning my mac keyboard",
        "url": "https://www.are.na/siyang/gpt-instructions-for-cleaning-my-mac-keyboard"
      }
    },
    "kind": "reblog"
  },
  {
    "id": "arena:96761428",
    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "text": "Crumbs removal (safe):\n1) Flip + tap\nPower off\nHold upside down (~45–90°)\nGently tap chassis → dislodge debris\n2) Compressed air\nShort bursts, angled\nMove key-to-key (don’t blast straight down)\n3) Soft brush\nClean paintbrush / anti-static brush\nSweep gaps while inverted\n4) Then alcohol cycle (for stickiness)\n1–2 drops ≥90% isopropyl at edge\nTap key 20–30x\nTilt to drain\nDry 30 min",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/45891048",
    "published_at": "2026-05-06T13:56:01.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T16:09:01.296Z",
    "images": [],
    "tags": [],
    "visibility": "public",
    "meta": {
      "block_type": "Text",
      "channel": {
        "title": "☉ gpt instructions for cleaning my mac keyboard",
        "url": "https://www.are.na/siyang/gpt-instructions-for-cleaning-my-mac-keyboard"
      }
    },
    "kind": "reblog"
  },
  {
    "id": "arena:96761424",
    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "text": "If still sticky after that:\nSugar corrosion likely → requires top case / keyboard replacement\nApple doesn’t repair individual keys reliably\nAvoid:\nPrying caps off\nWater\nExcess liquid (flooding keyboard)",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/45891046",
    "published_at": "2026-05-06T13:55:55.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T16:09:01.296Z",
    "images": [],
    "tags": [],
    "visibility": "public",
    "meta": {
      "block_type": "Text",
      "channel": {
        "title": "☉ gpt instructions for cleaning my mac keyboard",
        "url": "https://www.are.na/siyang/gpt-instructions-for-cleaning-my-mac-keyboard"
      }
    },
    "kind": "reblog"
  },
  {
    "id": "arena:96761415",
    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "text": "3) Compressed air\nShort bursts around key edges (after alcohol step)",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/45891039",
    "published_at": "2026-05-06T13:55:51.000Z",
    "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T16:09:01.296Z",
    "images": [],
    "tags": [],
    "visibility": "public",
    "meta": {
