  {
    "id": "arena:96761400",
    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "text": "1) Flush residue (most important)\nPower off\nLightly dampen cloth / cotton swab with isopropyl alcohol (≥90%)\nWork around edges of sticky keys\nPress keys repeatedly while cleaning (helps pull liquid inside)\nLet dry 30–60 min",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/45891033",
    "published_at": "2026-05-06T13:55:42.000Z",
